      "body": "I would suggest to report this to Intel.\n\n[This line](https://github.com/realsenseai/librealsense/blob/5f887da65b474935cf335c6f36ef7e743de4c2a4/tools/realsense-viewer/CMakeLists.txt#L265-L268) installs that `.preset` into `$HOME`, which on the buildfarm is set to `/home/buildfarm`. This then gets added to the `.deb`.\n\nThey should find another way to do that.",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I would suggest to report this to Intel.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/realsenseai/librealsense/blob/5f887da65b474935cf335c6f36ef7e743de4c2a4/tools/realsense-viewer/CMakeLists.txt#L265-L268\">This line</a> installs that <code class=\"notranslate\">.preset</code> into <code class=\"notranslate\">$HOME</code>, which on the buildfarm is set to <code class=\"notranslate\">/home/buildfarm</code>. This then gets added to the <code class=\"notranslate\">.deb</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">They should find another way to do that.</p>",
      "bodyVersion": "9514c438a59674809dd04e08aaa66a58579287c3a6788fc8694b83dec3ba1ab2",
